    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you leaning against the wall in a weird pose? I thought I was looking at a statue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could have heard my joints crack if you came in earlier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should pay a visit to an artificer, see if I can't get some cushioning for my waist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure the gun-knight armorsmiths take into account the special needs of the elderly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Young gun-knights need it too! It helps mitigate the recoil from our guns!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Nativity is tomorrow. How are preparations at the Shrine of Nurtury?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mother is in stable condition. Andoain has taken good care of her. She will give birth to a healthy, beautiful infant tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wi\u0161'adel and the Kazdelian delegation, the Twin Empresses and the Leithanian delegation, the delegation from the \u00c6gir Institute of Development Planning, the Tianshi delegation led by Yan's Envoy of Ceremonial Rites...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tomorrow, all the visitors to the Holy City are invited to the Shrine of Nurtury to witness the birth of a new life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you need me, then, if everything is in order?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our newest cardinal...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She came to see the Matriarch. I'm wondering\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did she 'happen' to pass by as she was investigating the bombings, 'drop in' to take a look, and then propose to provide help to the Shrine of Nurtury on a 'whim'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "text": "At first, I thought she came because of the attack on Andoain. But when I saw the look on her face after she saw the Matriarch... it is clear that she has suspicions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I quelled those.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen possesses a keen edge that few others have, especially when focused on a single matter. There is certainly no better fit for a cardinal of the Seventh Tribunal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the same time, there is also no worse fit. More often than not, she relies solely on her own judgment when it comes to where she will focus her attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do we need to be on guard against her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You make us sound like some evil organization plotting to overthrow Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "For some, the future that we usher in will overturn life as they know it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our empathy, our kindred and family, even the concept of 'Sankta' itself... existing limitations will be cast aside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "This should have been the predetermined end of Laterano's path, but the path has gone on far too long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some people take the accidents that happened in the process as the norm, and now they can't accept the predetermined end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1780_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should prepare early.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll deal with Lemuen. You head back to the Shrine of Nurtury and get ready for tomorrow's ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "May the Lord's blessings be with this city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
