    },
    {
        "text": "The red-headed Sankta runs through a forest of white and blue, like a tiny flame flickering in the rain."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#10$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That cloud on that comfort bell is almost the size of Croissant's van... and a cradle large enough to hold two cargo containers...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_comfortbell",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "The clouds hanging upon the comfort bells seem to block out the sunlight, and the hands holding up the cradles reaching towards the clouds."
    },
    {
        "text": "In this place, every living thing appears small and insignificant."
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the heck...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
