    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It feels so empty and quiet, but more than half of these nurseries are occupied...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Children, outsiders, even Fallen Angels... the Nurturers are busy. Looks like they've been living here for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't they say most of the facilities are empty and will only open to the public when that ceremony is done?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not true at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to recover the bombs!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I could stop the ceremony by blowing up the venue, but this place is full of people...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "To think I went through all that effort to slip past the guards...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_tidyequipment",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#10$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I wish the girls were here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Texas could've knocked out all the guards and dragged them outside, or Croissant could've barged into the rooms and packed up everyone inside...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#5$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or I could just get the boss to do a meet-and-greet opposite the ceremony to draw everybody's attention...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_tidyequipment",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#10$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, forget it. There's no time, I gotta get to work...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take these bombs apart and think of another way\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be easier if you cut the blue wire first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#6$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whah...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "When did you get back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "El.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
