    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "An entirely unremarkable apartment, except for the fact that its roof offers a perfect view of the plaza in front of the Shrine of Nurtury.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that why you chose to hide here, Arturia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Another happy reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And much sooner than I expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You did not attempt to conceal your trail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "The paper dragonfly was a clear clue. I saw you use such musical Arts more than once in Zwillingst\u00fcrme.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I hate to admit it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you've learned a whole lot of my secrets, Fede.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did our executor here not tell you that I am his beloved <i>soror</i>, Sister Hildegard?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are my distant relative. And that does not impede me from exercising oversight over you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before I brought you back to Laterano, on the outskirts of Zwillingst\u00fcrme, I warned you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will increase my vigilance over you in order to determine the subjective motivations and possible objective consequences of your actions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I will shoot to kill if I find anything suspicious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember the sunset that day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So hardheaded he's fun, isn't he, Sister Hildegard?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were always cooperative, Arturia. That's why Landen Monastery gave you a degree of leeway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard"
    },
    {
        "text": "You deceived us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I apologize, Sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope my impertinence will not be detrimental to you or to Landen Monastery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you leave Landen Monastery without permission, Arturia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at this shrine, Fede.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So vast, so full of vitality. It reaches into the clouds, surpassing even the eponymous twin towers of Zwillingst\u00fcrme in Leithanien...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this the 'grace' and 'authority' that Laterano wants to build?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the haloless outsiders being guided inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are Laterano's plans for them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What have you found, Arturia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember our short stay at Rhodes Island before returning to Laterano?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I met a mysterious guest there, who told me that there may come a day when Laterano is no longer a warm, cozy little cottage for the Sanktas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fede, Sister Hildegard. Look at what lies before you. Do you not suspect that the day has come?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What has become of the Holy City that we were so proud of?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1784_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hildegard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_245_cello_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are ever vigilant, Fede. You must have noticed something, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, you would have greeted me with the barrel of your gun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
