        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are those bombs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They look pretty powerful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sis! You're walking again?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh-huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hooray!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it you that I saw on Via Jovita, and that Amos saw outside the firearms workshop?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you manage to make so many bombs despite the Curia's strict control of explosive materials...? You're as good at this as ever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#5$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. Spit it out, El. What are you trying to do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blow up the shrine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop the Nativity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or sabotage the whole Summit of Nations?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay back, sis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "61_i07",
        "block": false,
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 65,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A massive pillar cuts the light and shadow open. Lemuen stops in her tracks, keeping her distance from Exusiai."
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a cardinal's cassock you're wearing, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does it look good on me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Totally! It's so cool!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was a little loose around the waist when I got it the day before my creation. I had to stay up all night fixing it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, I wish I wasn't wearing this for our reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you come back by yourself, or do you have friends with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you're pumping me for information now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a simple girl, after all. You're not in a school, and this isn't a graduation ceremony. Did you really just decide to liven things up like this on your own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's behind you, and why did they put you up to this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, let's try this\u2014'Apple pie with mayonnaise!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Had a slice, want another.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "You remembered!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "When we had a fight that wasn't going anywhere or a secret we didn't want to share, that's our password to set things aside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can feel your emotions, El. Agitation, impatience, worry, not even knowing how to explain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "But my job is to capture the culprits who are trying to sabotage the Summit of Nations. I will file a request with the Curia to personally handle the follow-up to this case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sankta sisters stand off against one another, neither making a single move, nor speaking a single word. It is Lemuen who finally breaks the silence with a sigh."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
