    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "In that instant, Exusiai flies toward her and hugs her tightly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#11$2",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that's the reaction I know from an El in trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I missed you, sis!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a while. Have you grown?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not! I was almost an adult when I left Laterano!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't have to talk like you're my mom, sis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that what I sound like?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you tie your hair yourself? It's coming loose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me tie it for you... still careless as ever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, I'm not as good as you at that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing here, anyway? Don't tell me you knew I would show up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just reviewing the shrine's security measures... I thought it was remarkable enough to see the Matriarch praying for a pregnant Sarkaz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then I ran into you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Matriarch... pregnant Sarkaz... praying...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Could the Nativity be...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you don't know what's in this shrine either?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, is it <i>your</i> turn to pump <i>me</i> for information?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who taught you to do that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1041_angel2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't turn bad, I promise! The people who're supporting me now\u2014they're a good influence, I promise!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not alone, and I'm not being used.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
